{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_942.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"43477c6fb0b51721d176d1a3fa25bef3a6d648a1c8c112e1832ea0d6fcdef490","ja":"クッキング大運動会、ふたたび！？","zh":"烹饪大运动会，再来一次！？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_942.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"f90f64173f361d36b49feb03066a0d4c6aa53eed93e772c588fac68006559a6b","ja":"クッキング大運動会、楽しかったね！\nでも実は……、まだ終わりじゃないんだぞ！","zh":"料理大运动会，好开心啊！\n但其实……还没结束呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_942.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"62cd4d29178934af8bdb6a4c6f78519f41bdcb99e7c8b82839b8e67e3dfce798","ja":"え、どういうこと？\n大会は無事に終わったと思ったんだけど……。","zh":"诶，怎么回事？\n我还以为大赛已经顺利结束了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_942.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"2144c89cb30a35bf01bbcab6abf9e1274ea79aec048e74c982eca278083160e8","ja":"ふっふっふ。これから始まるのは、題して\n『クッキング大運動会NEXT』さー！","zh":"哼哼哼。接下来要开始的，名为\n《料理大运动会NEXT》啦——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_942.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"1a4e0168b2f5e540cbd6d0815284bcade30a9d84d24130bf8e16271d8e0d6c5b","ja":"……？　ねえ、響さん、\nそれってどういうものなの？","zh":"……？　喂，响，\n那是什么？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_942.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"d9c887abb0ebfa12d7863fb2d50d0479cb8cc32a2a58fda8d8897f406ee69553","ja":"文字通り、クッキング大運動会の続編さー。\nでも、同じことをやるわけじゃないからね。","zh":"字面意义上，就是料理大运动会的续篇啦——。\n不过，也不是要做同样的事情哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_942.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"6a2bd2a01d5d5e2abdecb17691eaa101886d18e76442b64f3e6ed905044facc8","ja":"次は、運動しながら料理をして競い合うんだ！\n例えば自分は……卓球を選択するさー！","zh":"接下来，一边运动一边做菜，比比看谁厉害！\n比如说我嘛……就选乒乓球啦——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_942.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"5a2119276a0bdc0749f3ee49c018b1a3ad54e0768217cefdc5527f0881c164ea","ja":"卓球しながら料理……えええ～！？","zh":"边打乒乓球边做饭……诶诶诶～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_942.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"da4ba0977d60c06949042fc47478b3a4511c30c577c076f9b18d79005e0ba9d3","ja":"自分の華麗なサーブで、あそこにあるパスタを\n割ってお湯の入った鍋にインするよ！　見ててよねっ！","zh":"我要用我华丽的发球，把那边的意大利面\n折断，丢进盛着热水的锅里！你可要看好了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_942.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"75eb1c5beafbadac494a6e7a5e9ea6e8515f47f03cf7105b9967833af470452b","ja":"えいっ！","zh":"嘿！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_942.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"4f874276ca942c1bb64fa0affa4f3d6dccd0fd4484e5051a068311a48e8461d0","ja":"響さん、さすがにむりがあるよ！　……って、\nあっ！？　成功してる！！　パスタがゆだっていくよ！","zh":"响，这果然还是不行啊！　……咦，\n啊！？　成功了！！　意大利面正在煮着呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_942.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"365b9cb74f807e56cae42c168a7992dd1a9f8240c5c8136acf6a71fd257cda23","ja":"えっ！？\nい、いや自分なら当たり前さー！","zh":"诶！？\n不、不是，对自己来说这是理所当然的啦——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_942.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"077c272b825327e7f5c8201367b2acbe9b82884024e4481a07dbe0fb74ce94e1","ja":"……正直、自分でも成功するとは思わなかった\n……な、何でもないぞ！","zh":"……老实说，连我自己都没想到会成功\n……没、没什么！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
